STATUS: Active
TITLE: Instance split and naming
STATEMENT: >>>
`_instances` splits a family frame by its `inst` column into one frame per integer instance, without the
`inst` column. `store_instances(topics, name, frames)` stores the lowest instance under `name` and every other
instance `i` under `<name>_<i>`, each with a fresh index.
