[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-PRS-037
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dataflash battery
STATEMENT: >>>
`_battery_topics` produces `battery_status` per BAT instance: `voltage_v` (V), `current_a` (A), `temperature`
(degrees C), `current_consumed_mah` (mAh) as logged, without rows where voltage and current are both NaN.
`remaining` is `RemPct / 100` when the log has any, else the column is left out (it is not derived from
consumed charge). `internal_resistance_estimate` is left out when it is all NaN. `capacity` is added on every
row from the parameter `BATT_CAPACITY` (instance 0) or `BATT<i+1>_CAPACITY` when it is greater than 0.
<<<
