[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-PRS-038
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dataflash battery cells
STATEMENT: >>>
`_with_cells` treats a BCL cell value as valid when it is above 0 and below `NO_CELL_MV` (65 535), converts
the valid cells from mV to V (divide by 1000), numbers the cells that ever report from 0 as
`voltage_cell_v[k]`, joins them to the battery rows of the same instance by nearest time within 100 000 us,
and sets `cell_count` to the number of reporting cells. With no reporting cell the battery frame is returned
unchanged.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: parsers
RELATIONS:
