[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-PRS-039
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dataflash GPS position
STATEMENT: >>>
`_gps_topics` produces `vehicle_gps_position` per receiver. Rows with NaN `lat`, `lon` or `fix_type` are
dropped with no warning. `lat` and `lon` are `round(degrees x 1e7)` as int64; `alt` is
`round(metres x 1000)` in millimetres as float64; `fix_type` is the GPS `Status` as int64 (same 0 to 6 scale);
`satellites_used` is `NSats`; `hdop` is `HDop` as the reader scaled it (a plain ratio). `gwk` and `gms` are
removed. It returns `None` and adds no topic when the log has no GPS message.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
