[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-PRS-040
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dataflash GPS accuracy
STATEMENT: >>>
`_gps_topics` joins the GPA rows of the same receiver that have any of `eph` (HAcc, m), `epv` (VAcc, m) and
`s_variance_m_s` (SAcc, m/s) to the GPS rows by nearest time within 50 000 us. A GPS row with no GPA row in
that window has NaN in these columns.
