[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-PRS-044
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dataflash estimator test ratios
STATEMENT: >>>
`_ekf_topics` uses NKF4 when the parameter `AHRS_EKF_TYPE` (default 3) is 2 and NKF4 is logged, or when XKF4
is not logged; otherwise XKF4. Per core it gives `vel_test_ratio`, `pos_test_ratio`, `hgt_test_ratio`,
`mag_test_ratio`, `tas_test_ratio` as the square of SV, SP, SH, SM, SVT, and `fault_status`, `timeout_status`,
`solution_status`, `gps_check_status`, `primary_core` as logged. The primary core is the most frequent `PI`
that is 0 or more, else the lowest core. It is stored as `ekf_test_ratios`; the lowest core, when displaced,
as `ekf_test_ratios_<primary>`; any other core `i` as `ekf_test_ratios_<i>`.
<<<
