[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-PRS-052
STATUS: Active
TITLE: One vehicle from a shared link
STATEMENT: >>>
`_pick_vehicle(hb)` takes the HEARTBEAT rows whose `autopilot` is not 8 (invalid) and whose `type` is not 6
(ground station) and returns the (system id, component id) pair with the most such rows, with the most frequent
`autopilot` and `type` of that pair; with no such row it returns `(None, None, None)`. `parse` then keeps only
that pair's rows in every frame and adds the warning "Ignored <n> messages from other systems on the link (GCS,
gimbal, companion computer)." when n, the rows dropped outside HEARTBEAT, is above 0. With no vehicle it keeps
every sender's rows, drops the HEARTBEAT frame (no arming state) and adds the warning "No autopilot HEARTBEAT in
this log, so messages from every system on the link were used.". STATUSTEXT and AUTOPILOT_VERSION texts and
parameters are kept only from the vehicle.
<<<
