TITLE: Telemetry ESC
STATEMENT: >>>
`_esc_status(frames)` takes ESC_STATUS rows (rpm, voltage, current as sent) and ESC_TELEMETRY_1_TO_4 to 9_TO_12
rows (rpm; voltage x 0.01 V; current x 0.01 A; temperature in deg C) per ESC slot. The number of ESCs is the
largest ESC_INFO `count` above 0, else the highest slot that ever reports a non-zero value plus one; slots at or
above it are dropped. The rest are merged with `merge_esc` and `esc_count` is set. An ESC without its own
temperature takes the ESC_INFO temperature (x 0.01 deg C, 32767 missing) of the nearest ESC_INFO row within 2 s.
With no ESC row it returns None.
