[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-PRS-068
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Blackbox parse warnings
STATEMENT: >>>
`BetaflightParser.parse` adds "<n> damaged blackbox frames were skipped." when the decoder's `corrupt` count is
above 0, "The header has no acc_1G, so the accelerometer couldn't be scaled." when accelerometer fields exist
without `acc_1G`, and "Battery voltage units for <firmware> <version> aren't known; battery skipped." when a
voltage field exists but `_battery` returns None.
